# The oldest browsers the web apps support. It is the build target Vite 8
# compiles the plain-Vite apps to by default ("baseline-widely-available":
# Chrome/Edge 111, Firefox 114, Safari 16.4), written out so a change to the
# floor is an edit someone reviews rather than a side effect of a caniuse-lite
# refresh. musubi/social/tests/browser-floor.test.ts fails when the two differ.
#
# Astro builds its client bundle at `esnext`, so nothing lowers the syntax of
# the Astro apps to this floor; see wiki/shared/frontend-patterns.md.
chrome >= 111
edge >= 111
firefox >= 114
safari >= 16.4
ios_saf >= 16.4
